      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false
        },
        "content": "### \u2139\ufe0f Nawari Local Pilot Network Experience\n**Measurement Provenance:** Endpoint Go Collector (`nawari.plugin`) \u2192 Netdata Child (`2.12.3`) \u2192 Grafana-Alloy (`1.11.0`) \u2192 Grafana-Mimir (`3.0.0`).\n**Diagnostic Scope:** Synthetic local pilot fixture probes (`fixture-portal_page`) measuring HTTP timing, DNS lookup, default gateway RTT, and ICMP destination reachability.\n*Notice: These metrics represent local pilot diagnostic probes; they do not represent production business application performance.*",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.6.0",
      "title": "Local Pilot Scope & Measurement Provenance",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nawari-local-mimir"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "noValue": "STALE / NO DATA",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#EAB839",
